    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>nb</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>For å registrere fysiske og funksjonelle egenskaper til et lumen i et kateter eller tubulært medisinsk utstyr.</purpose>
      <use>Brukes for å registrere detaljer om et lumen i et kateter eller rør, enten det er enkeltlumens eller flerlumens.&#xD;
&#xD;
For enkeltlumensutstyr brukes denne arketypen én gang for å fange lumenets egenskaper. For flerlumensutstyr brukes denne arketypen flere ganger, én gang for hvert lumen. Denne arketypen er designet for å brukes i CLUSTER.device_catheter-arketypen eller lignende arketyper for utstyrsegenskaper.</use>
      <misuse>Brukes ikke for å dokumentere innsettingsteknikker eller prosedyretrinn; bruk ACTION.procedure i stedet.</misuse>
      <copyright>© openEHR Foundation</copyright>
    </details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>en</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>To record the physical and functional properties of a lumen within a catheter or tubular medical device.</purpose>
      <use>Use to record details about a lumen within a catheter or tube, whether single-lumen or multi-lumen.&#xD;
&#xD;
For single-lumen devices, use this archetype once to capture the lumen properties. For multi-lumen devices, use this archetype multiple times, once for each lumen. This archetype is designed to be nested within the CLUSTER.device_catheter archetype or similar device property archetypes.</use>
      <misuse>Not to be used to document insertion techniques or procedural steps; use ACTION.procedure instead.</misuse>
      <copyright>© openEHR Foundation</copyright>
    </details>
  </description>
